1. Code Changes
---------------
- In `kernel/src/proc.rs`:
  Updated `bad_mem_user_entry` from probing unmapped `0xffff800000000000` to probing
  the base of the mapped higher-half kernel text at `0xffffffff80000000`.
- In `kernel/src/trustselftest.rs`:
  Updated PID 2 (`bad_mem`) exit assertion to require:
  - vector == 14 (#PF)
  - cr2 == 0xffffffff80000000
  - (code & 1) != 0 (P=1: protection violation on present kernel page)
  - (code & 4) != 0 (U=1: fault occurred during user-mode CPL=3 execution)

